`headHasRealFailure(repoInfo, headSha)` is exactly the (b) probe: true when the head carries failing checks (fail-open on probe error). Plus the `validation_failed` label check.

Now the census helper: I need ALL unresolved threads (not just machine ones). I'll add a helper `unresolvedThreadCount(repoInfo, prNumber)` in smAgent modeled on `unresolvedMachineThreadCount` but counting every unresolved thread. Returns -1 on failure (tool unavailable), fail toward legacy escalation.

